| **`smoke.md`** | Deploy evidence: isolated profile, install, cold boot, token→Cookie exchange, `/ping` matrix, tool probe, composition coverage |
| **`release.md`** | Version-bump decision, dist-tag policy, and the full pre-publish gate list; **no publish performed** |
